fake-printer
============

This repository contains wrapper scripts (dashboard, postprocess, setup helpers)
licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

Third-party dependency
----------------------

At setup time, this project clones and runs:

  paperlessprinter — https://github.com/paperlesspaper/paperlessprinter
  License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)

paperlessprinter is NOT bundled in this repository. It is downloaded into
`paperlessprinter/` (gitignored) when you run `scripts/setup.ps1`.

If you modify paperlessprinter or distribute a combined work that includes it,
you must comply with the AGPL-3.0 terms for that component.

Rust port (rust/)
-----------------

`rust/` contains a single-binary Rust port whose IPP engine is a port of
paperlessprinter. The entire Rust crate is therefore licensed under
AGPL-3.0 (see rust/LICENSE), not MIT.

The Rust build embeds PDFium (https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/),
BSD-3-Clause, obtained from https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries
(release chromium/7881, SHA-256 pinned in rust/build.rs). See
rust/third_party/pdfium/LICENSE.
